			"Message": "docs(Mist): Correct license link to point to Mist repository\n\nThe README.md badge link for the CC0-1.0 license incorrectly pointed to the `Land` repository root. Update the URL to target the `Mist` submodule repository to reflect the accurate license location for the WebSocket and DNS isolation component.\n\nThis ensures documentation accuracy and directs users to the correct legal context for the Mist crate.",
